# Concept -> public IRI -> why (all IRIs verified in fibo/verified_iris.json)
#  Actor (7 roles) -> Commons Organizations/LegalPerson -> verified; actors modelled as legal persons (no verified role class beyond Payer/Payee)
#  PO / WO 4663098-05 -> FND Contracts/Contract + ContractualCommitment -> PO binds client NEST to vendor; commitment carries NTE
#  PO scope -> ProductsAndServices/ServiceAgreement -> plumbing service agreement
#  NTE $200 cap, cost lines -> FND CurrencyAmount/MonetaryAmount -> integer cents in rdf:value; cap linked via dcterms:hasPart
#  Proposal $386.80 -> FBC FinancialProductsAndServices/Offering -> closest verified quote/offer class (Offer unverified)
#  Client approval -> FND Arrangements/Assessments/AssessmentEvent -> approval is an assessment event
#  Invoice -> PaymentsAndSchedules/PaymentObligation -> Invoice class unverified; obligation to pay
#  Tech payout -> PaymentsAndSchedules/Payment, Payee, Payer -> accounting pays technician
#  36 steps -> W3C PROV-O prov:Activity -> prov:wasInformedBy chain, prov:atTime ordinal instants
@prefix rdf: <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#> .
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .
@prefix xsd: <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .
@prefix prov: <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#> .
@prefix dcterms: <http://purl.org/dc/terms/> .
@prefix wt: <https://fortnox.example/data/walkthrough/> .

